{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04757","headline":"宿直温泉宫羽林献诗 · 张说","name":"宿直温泉宫羽林献诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"冬狩美秦正，新丰乐汉行。\n星陈玄武阁，月对羽林营。\n寒木罗霜仗，空山响夜更。\n恩深灵液暖，节劲古松贞。\n文武皆王事，输心不爲名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04757.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04757","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}